<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55991" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτ-οιδα</span></b> , -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οισθα</span>,
			inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειδέναι</span>, part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειδώς</span> (
			Locr.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταειδώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					366
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				6
			</span></i> (Tolophon, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>)), pf. (in
				pres. sense), plpf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατῄδη</span> (in impf.
				sense):—<i>know well, understand</i>, c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστρων ὁμήγυριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν κάτοισθα τῶν σαυτοῦ πέρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					553
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσφάτων βάξιν κατῄδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					87
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλον νώδυνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατειδὼς τὴν γυναικείαν φύσιν, ὡς . .
					ἥδεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					43
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν κατειδώς, ἀλλὰ προσποιούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					628
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵν᾽ εὖ κατειδῇς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					164
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.pers.,
				<i>know by sight, recognize</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν βοτῆρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					1048
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				418
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1183
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1521
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs., esp. in
				part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ κατειδώς</span>
			<i>unwittingly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Med.</u>
				992
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1033
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> c.
				part., <i>know well that</i> . . , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτισθι μὴ πολλοὺς ἔτι τρόχους . .
					τελῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1064
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> folld. by an
			interrog., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ κάτοιδ᾽ ὅπως
			λέγεις</span> I <i>understand</i> not how . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				270
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ κ. ὅτῳ τρόπῳ</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1245
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> c.
			inf., <i>know how</i> to, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ
				κάτοισθα δηλῶσαι λόγῳ</span>; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1041
			</span></i>.</div>
